      "structure_description": "A hamburger-like, three-layer Dy8Nb64 molecular cluster: two square Dy4 units, linked by carbonate and risedronic-acid ligands, lie between two rectangular γ-Nb32 polyoxoniobate macrocycles and connect to them through Nb–O–Dy linkages."
